\title{Yoneda Lemma for Simplicial Spaces}
\date{2023-07-11}
\author{nimarasekh}
\meta{doi}{10.1007/s10485-023-09734-z}
\taxon{Reference}
\import{stt-macros}

\subtree{
\taxon{Abstract}
\p{
We study the Yoneda lemma for arbitrary simplicial spaces. We do that by introducing
left fibrations of simplicial spaces and studying their associated model structure,
the covariant model structure. In particular, we prove a recognition principle for
covariant equivalences over an arbitrary simplicial space and invariance of the
covariant model structure with respect to complete Segal space equivalences.
}
}

